{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261128/photo/bkn-20261128070839963-1128_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261128083750\"/><p>事發在蕙荃路22至66號商場保安室。</p><p>荃灣有人暈倒亡。今日(28日)凌晨4時13分，蕙荃路22至66號商場保安員報案，指一名姓周(35歲)男同事在保安室內暈倒。救護車接報到場將昏迷事主送院搶救，惟最終證實不治。警員經初步調查，案件列「送院時死亡」跟進，其死因仍有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T01:03:52.675950+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T23:08:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T00:57:29.208486+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T00:57:29.208486+00:00","content_hash":"ab618a5380a01dc7893d6cff2cdb5913006f4aff4519d2b0235b1dddede9581d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}